SOLUTION 1 Pure DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol

SOLUTION 2 Pure Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file mix_heat.sel
    -temperature
    -solution
    -step
    -high_precision
USER_PUNCH 1
    -headings density
    10 PUNCH RHO
